      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.achp.gov/preserve-america/community/lincoln-rhode-island",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Lincoln shares borders with seven other Rhode Island towns, tying it for the most neighboring municipalities in the state.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
